---
title: "Linked file row: what a member sees"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: No row yet, folder indexing
  s1: No row yet
  s2: Listed, Open shown
  s3: Opening
  s4: Opened
  s5: Unavailable, holders named
  s6: Newer version on its way
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: the folder finishes indexing
  s0 --> s2: the row appears
  s1 --> s2: the row appears
  s2 --> s3: opens it
  s3 --> s4: its chunks arrive
  s3 --> s5: no holder answers
  s5 --> s3: opens it
  s5 --> s2: the owner's Device wakes
  s2 --> s5: the owner's Device sleeps
  s2 --> s6: the owner edits it
  s5 --> s6: the owner's Device wakes
  s6 --> s3: opens it
  s6 --> s5: the owner's Device sleeps
  s6 --> s2: the edit is published
